< \r\nTopics: language grants jobs keys settings errors tour
^ \r\nCommands:
^ \r\n  bg        continue a stopped job in the background
^ \r\n  cat       print files
^ \r\n  cd        change the current directory
^ \r\n  count     count arguments, or the lines of files
^ \r\n  cp        copy a file
^ \r\n  echo      print its arguments
^ \r\n  exit      end this shell; a new one starts
^ \r\n  export    give a variable to the programs you run
^ \r\n  fg        continue a job in the foreground
^ \r\n  find      find files by name
^ \r\n  grants    show what a command would be given, without running it
^ \r\n  head      print the first lines of files
^ \r\n  help      show help
^ \r\n  history   list the lines you have run
^ \r\n  jobs      list jobs
^ \r\n  kill      end a job
^ \r\n  ls        list a directory
^ \r\n  math      calculate
^ \r\n  mkdir     make a directory
^ \r\n  mv        move or rename
^ \r\n  poweroff  turn the machine off
< -- space: next page, q: quit --
> \x20
<   pwd       print the current directory
^ \r\n  reboot    start the machine again
^ \r\n  rm        remove files
